# ConditionalConfigSync (shudnal): standalone shared config-sync + server-policy library, the
# modern replacement for the old bundled ServerSync. Added 2026-09-21 as the HARD DEPENDENCY of
# HarpoonExtended (Harpoon 1.2.0 switched to it and refuses to run without a compatible copy on
# server + client). Deps only BepInEx. Harpoon needs >=1.0.5; pinned at latest 1.0.9. It runs
# server-side (distributes config + enforces version handshake) AND every client that runs a mod
# consuming it must match -> plugin+required. TWO DLLs: the package ships both the library
# (ConditionalConfigSync.dll) AND the BepInEx entrypoint (ConditionalConfigSync.Plugin.dll,
# GUID _shudnal.ConditionalConfigSync) — BOTH must be staged, or the plugin never registers and
# Harpoon fails with "missing dependencies: _shudnal.ConditionalConfigSync". One manifest line per
# DLL (the format is one SHA-pinned DLL per line); both come from the same package zip/url.
# Bumped 1.0.9 -> 1.0.10 on 2026-10-04 (adds a soft-dependency API for mod authors; mod-fetch.sh
# only extracts the library DLL, so the .Plugin DLL was pulled from the zip by hand again).
# Bumped 1.0.10 -> 1.0.11 on 2026-10-16 (config-sync transfers keep going on slow connections while
# they make progress; needs the update on server AND clients). .Plugin DLL again pulled by hand.
ConditionalConfigSync|1.0.11|ConditionalConfigSync.dll|9e3aa79de10b31a4ee06e7cd94faf46d87b3bf3ec64ea3d15b07a396836f8b8a|plugin+required|https://thunderstore.io/package/download/shudnal/ConditionalConfigSync/1.0.11/
ConditionalConfigSync.Plugin|1.0.11|ConditionalConfigSync.Plugin.dll|9aa35c2ce769dfefb01bcdec77cf2c64227ce7c41b995a2b982516449c18290f|plugin+required|https://thunderstore.io/package/download/shudnal/ConditionalConfigSync/1.0.11/
